LOCUS       pH2rU3_ForInd_H7       10315 bp    DNA     linear   SYN 10-JUL-2024
DEFINITION  Forward inducible lentivirus backbone coding for Anhui strain of H7 
            (genscript optimization) with and 21aa CTD deletion, and zsGreen 
            that is linked to puromycin resistance gene by T2A linker.
